<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - DNS prices mostly up.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - DNS prices mostly up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat cash bids were mostly higher on Monday in line with stronger futures on the Minneapolis Grain Exchange.</p>
<p>&quot;We had quite a bit of grain coming to the Minneapolis floor last week for spot shipment,&quot; a Minneapolis cash grain dealer said, but harsh winter conditions in parts of Minnesota are expected to hamper movement this week.</p>
<p>Another Montana dealer said he saw some movement. &quot;A few people sold into the rally this morning,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>MGE spring wheat futures settled one to 3-1/2 cents per bushel higher, with March up 3-1/2 cents at $3.84.  </p>
